"Decides whether or not an icon accompanies the post, and if so, which icon."
msgstr "Legt fest, ob und, falls ja, welches Symbol den Beitrag begleitet."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: en/chapters/moderator_guide.xml:45
