#. (itstool) path: caption/para
#: en/chapters/moderator_guide.xml:105
msgid ""
"The quick moderator tools. As you can see, these tools are located at the "
"end of each topic at the bottom of the page, before the last post on that "
"page. Clicking on the mallet icon will show you all of the actions you may "
"perform."
